   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "When something happens",
   "texto": [
    "Before **때** («time / time») a time-dependent form is used. For a present or usual situation: **-(으)ㄹ 때** with verbs (**갈 때**, when I go; **먹을 때**, when I eat) and adjectives (**바쁠 때**, when I am busy). For a past situation: **-았/었을 때** (**한국에 갔을 때**, when I went to Korea)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "A common expression",
   "texto": [
